osmosis - https://github.com/KonradIT/osmosis
MIT License

The DUML frame layout, the checksum parameters, the BLE pairing and Wi-Fi
provisioning command values, and the media manifest and download endpoints used
by camDL's DJI support were all published by this project, which documents them
against an Osmo Action 5 Pro. camDL implements them independently from those
notes; no source was copied.

osmosis in turn credits dji-remote (https://github.com/dimadesu/dji-remote, MIT)
for the DUML checksum algorithm.
